  "why": "The run is the second season of Hana-Kimi, a 13 episode summer 2026 show that started 2026-07-02 and is still airing (anilist and kitsu give an end of 2026-09-17, anizip still lists episode 13 as unaired on 2026-09-23). anizip:19961 is the same run: it carries first-party SAME_AS ids to both mal:63780 and anilist:209669 and lists the same 13 episodes. cr:GT00365568-GS00376607 is the same run: it maps SAME_AS to all four members and its 12 listed episodes carry this run's episode titles in the same order (Definitely Weird, How Did You Know?!, Did You Do It?!, What Do You Want? are byte identical to anizip's), with only the 13th episode missing because it has not aired. jw:438204-580871 is the same run: it maps SAME_AS to anilist, anizip, kitsu, mal and offline and its 12 episode titles match anizip's one for one, its 2026-01-01 start being a JustWatch placeholder rather than an air date. cr:GT00365568 is the bare Hana-Kimi series page with no episodes or dates of its own, so it holds the run rather than being it. Crunchyroll and JustWatch episodes are paired to anizip's by exact title only, since Crunchyroll's dates run a week ahead of anizip's from episode 2 (both list 2026-07-01 for episodes 1 and 2) and JustWatch carries no dates at all; episodes 8 and 9 are left unpaired because the titles disagree there (The Doctor`s Boyfriend? against Teacher's Boyfriend?, Dont`t Look!! against Don't Look!!), as is Crunchyroll episode 12 (It Can't Be Helped against No Helping It). nf:82655955-2 is left unsettled: it has no dates, 12 episodes against the run's 13, and every title after the first is the placeholder Episode N, so nothing places it."
